{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13922","headline":"听早蝉歌 · 耿湋","name":"听早蝉歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蝉鸣兮夕曛，声和兮夏云。\n白日兮将短，秋意兮已满。\n乍悲鸣兮欲长，犹嘶涩兮多断。\n风萧萧兮转清，韵嘒嘒兮初成。\n依婆娑之古树，思辽落之荒城。\n闲院支颐，深林倚策。\n犹惆怅而无语，鬓星星而已白。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13922.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13922","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}